summary:
  A station's first title waits the full debounce before its cover is looked up.

history:
  The debounce exists for a StreamTitle that flaps. The first title after an
  empty header has nothing to flap against, and the full window only kept
  every station's first cover a second and a half further away.

target:
  package/contents/ui/ArtworkEngine.qml

find:
          artLookupDebounce.interval = first === true ? 200 : 1500;

replace:
          artLookupDebounce.interval = first === true ? 1500 : 1500;

expect:
  Killed by tst_artworkengine::test_the_first_title_of_a_station_does_not_wait_out_the_debounce.
  Line-neutral.
